heading: FIND THE MISSING
heading: CROSS WORDS
centre block: IT'S READS BOTH WAYS
intro: Here is another one of FUN'S word-cross puzzles. See if you can fill in the missing words.
instructions: Fill in the squares in the above diagram with words which correspond with the definitions given below. The solution will be given in next week's FUN.


